      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would be nice to have this, yes.\n\nWould allow Music Event Cinematographers like me be able to still communicate with people in-game (e.g. production team, asking visitors to switch avis, etc.) whilst still capturing the music without the voices for the recording.\n\nOther games like Rocket League allow you to switch the Voice Chat Output Device, so why does VRChat not yet?",
